   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "① L19 · Stateless servers\nAny server can take any\nrequest. One dies → the others\ncarry on. Only the database\nholds state.",
   "originalText": "① L19 · Stateless servers\nAny server can take any\nrequest. One dies → the others\ncarry on. Only the database\nholds state.",
