   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "② L21 · Live updates\nHTTP: client asks each time\n(keep-alive reuses the TCP\nconnection). WebSocket: one\nopen connection, server\npushes.",
   "originalText": "② L21 · Live updates\nHTTP: client asks each time\n(keep-alive reuses the TCP\nconnection). WebSocket: one\nopen connection, server\npushes.",
