   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "③ L20 · Auto-recovery\nA leader watches servers and\nrestarts dead ones. If the\nleader dies, the rest elect a\nnew leader — no human.",
   "originalText": "③ L20 · Auto-recovery\nA leader watches servers and\nrestarts dead ones. If the\nleader dies, the rest elect a\nnew leader — no human.",
